<!-- Charis の窓（元: 公式 Second_Life_Release#d567465e-26.5 の panel_preferences_chat.xml。research/266 prefs-w-chat）.
     Charis window: Preferences > Chat in the psui look. The official file stays as it is (the ledger's source:
     research/ui-ledger/map.json); every name, control_name, function and choice of it is here. The C++ asks for
     delete_transcripts / clear_log (LLButton), voice_call_friends_only_check (LLCheckBoxCtrl), the six IM drop-downs
     (LLComboBox), notifications_alert (LLTextBox), log_path_string, log_path_button, chat_font_size and
     conversation_log_combo by name: they are the compat widgets of those types (or the official line editor).
     The official sections (general_chat_settings, im_notification_settings, play_sound_settings, log_settings) are
     kept as the panels of the sections here; the headings h_* are Charis's.
     Size (1080 base; a preferences page, plus/prefscharis/prefs_tab_template.xml): 574 x 515, a scroll_container
     with a panel 557 wide. Rows at left 14, 529 wide. From the top:
       10
       general_chat_settings 163 = heading 40 + 3 checks 90 + the font size row 33
       10
       im_notification_settings 322 = heading 40 + check 30 + the e-mail link 24 + 6 + 6 rows (drop-down and its
                                      "Play sound") 198 + the note 24
       10
       play_sound_settings 154 = heading 40 + the label 24 + 3 rows of checks (two columns) 90
       10
       log_settings 165 = heading 40 + the drop-down row 33 + 6 + buttons 40 + 6 + the location row 40
       10
       heading 40 + 6 + the three buttons 40
       14
     = 954 (scrolls). An IM row: the label 14..164 (ja 12 characters), the drop-down 170..390, "Play sound" 398..543
     (ja 7 characters and the box, 122; de 136). ja: at most 38 characters on a line; the longest drop-down item is 14 characters (182 + the arrow). -->
